Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.77,0:00:31.05,Default,OTHER SCHOOL GIRL 1,0,0,0,,Oh... Excuse me, getting off!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:32.45,Default,OTHER SCHOOL GIRL 1,0,0,0,,I'd like to get—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.82,0:00:39.65,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:43.10,Default,OTHER SCHOOL GIRL 1,0,0,0,,Oh... Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:59.54,Default,OTHER SCHOOL GIRL 2,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you think that guy looks so cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.54,0:01:00.82,Default,OTHER SCHOOL GIRL 3,0,0,0,,I know, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.82,0:01:02.45,Default,OTHER SCHOOL GIRL 3,0,0,0,,My heart fluttered just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.45,0:01:04.89,Default,OTHER SCHOOL GIRL 2,0,0,0,,Such a beautiful face!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:09.22,Default,OTHER SCHOOL GIRL 3,0,0,0,,Wanna go ask him for his number?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:10.59,Default,OTHER SCHOOL GIRL 2,0,0,0,,You think I should?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:12.20,Default,OTHER SCHOOL GIRL 2,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:13.05,Default,OTHER SCHOOL GIRL 3,0,0,0,,Is that a...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:15.25,Default,OTHER SCHOOL GIRL 3,0,0,0,,Skirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.03,0:03:07.63,Default,PRESENT GIRL,0,0,0,,Y-Yoi Takiguchi-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:09.64,Default,PRESENT GIRL,0,0,0,,Please accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:16.17,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um... I'm sorry, but with this sort \Nof thing... I'm not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.09,0:03:35.15,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:36.65,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Again with the gifts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.33,0:03:39.23,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Nobara, Kotobuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:43.19,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Even in high school, you've still got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:45.89,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,You failed to say no again, huh, Yoi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:47.82,top,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, I feel bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:48.15,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,A tall, slender physique.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.15,0:03:50.22,top,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Or maybe you're actually enjoying it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.74,0:03:50.22,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,A slightly low-pitched voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:51.39,top,YOI,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:52.66,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,A masculine face inherited from my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.39,0:03:53.13,top,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,You're super popular with the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:55.82,top,NOBARA,0,0,0,,I wish someone would give me presents, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:55.02,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Yoi Takiguchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.02,0:03:56.47,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,First year in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:56.90,top,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:03:58.49,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.33,0:03:59.87,top,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Right, right... Come on, let's head to class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:00.83,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But everyone calls me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:03.62,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Hey, Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:08.82,Default,SENIOR FEMALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Isn't that the Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:10.09,Default,SENIOR FEMALE STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,You mean the first-year?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.09,0:04:11.60,Default,SENIOR FEMALE STUDENT 3,0,0,0,,Hey, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:13.16,Default,SENIOR FEMALE STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,Hey, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:16.27,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,I kinda get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.27,0:04:20.43,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan is way more appealing \Nthan most of the guys around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:22.90,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,That's right, it was during \Nlast year's field day...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:26.34,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,A girl fell down, and Yoi-chan carried \Nher all the way to the finish line!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:27.78,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,{\i1}And{\i0} came in first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:31.23,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, man, she was so {\i1}cool{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:35.31,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,How should I put it? Yoi-chan is like the \Nhero from a shojo manga, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.47,0:04:39.99,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,A hero, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.85,0:04:43.92,Default,GIFT-GIVING GIRL 1,0,0,0,,I wonder when the Prince will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:46.66,Default,GIFT-GIVING GIRL 2,0,0,0,,Oh man, your face is so red!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:48.06,Default,GIFT-GIVING GIRL 1,0,0,0,,What, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:50.61,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh, speak of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:53.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm going to take a detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.47,0:04:54.14,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:07.62,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:11.51,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Here. You dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:14.70,Default,HANDKERCHIEF GIRL 1,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:25.51,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,People do seem to take me more for a \Nhero or a prince than a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:29.59,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, it can't be helped, looking like I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:44.70,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:46.07,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:47.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I didn't see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:50.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:52.52,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:55.75,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What's with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.48,0:06:02.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.31,0:06:04.92,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're really beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.41,0:06:07.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:08.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're a dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.31,0:06:14.54,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.39,0:06:23.80,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Feels like I'd remember that guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:27.69,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0\fs15\c&HECE1CF&\frx354\fry332\frz346.4\move(377,64,436,64,0,2948)}Fourth period is study hall
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:27.69,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0\fs15\c&HECE1CF&\frx354\fry332\frz338.7\move(517,145,576,145,0,2948)}Textbook P30-46 Report
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:27.69,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0\fs15\c&HECE1CF&\move(500,274,559,274,0,2948)\frz332.4\frx350\fry334}Must be submitted!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:30.40,top,WHISPERING GIRL CLASSMATE 1,0,0,0,,The Prince is lost in thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:31.46,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Huh? Something wrong, Yoi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:31.46,top,WHISPERING GIRL CLASSMATE 2,0,0,0,,So beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.46,0:06:32.90,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,You look pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:34.41,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.41,0:06:35.66,top,CLASSMATE GIRL A,0,0,0,,What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.66,0:06:37.58,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Asking me if I'm a dude right to my face...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.66,0:06:39.37,top,CLASSMATE GIRL A,0,0,0,,Ichimura-senpai and the others are \Ngoing to play soccer in the gym!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:39.37,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Talk about rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:42.88,top,CLASSMATE GIRL B,0,0,0,,Yay! We get to watch them! Lucky us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.69,0:06:42.88,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What's all the fuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:46.27,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh, it must be about the other "Prince."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.27,0:06:48.09,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,"Other Prince"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.09,0:06:51.39,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Yep. Rumor has it that his \Ndad is a multi-millionaire
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:54.30,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,and is already in charge \Nof two or three companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:57.91,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Also, the number of women he's brought to \Ntears is easily in the triple digits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.10,0:07:02.29,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Doesn't sound that credible,\Neven for a rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:03.36,top,GIRL C,0,0,0,,Ichimura-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:06.02,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,A prince, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:09.78,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, not my concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:11.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:12.48,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.48,0:07:14.44,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Do your best at PE!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:17.33,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,He's the one from this morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:17.33,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,He's the one from this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:18.58,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:21.42,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Your ass okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:23.38,top,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,What? Yoi-chan? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:23.38,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What do you mean ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:23.38,overlaptop,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:24.44,Default,CLASSMATE GIRL A,0,0,0,,Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:27.38,Default,CLASSMATE GIRL B,0,0,0,,What?! You know Ichimura-senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:27.38,top,CLASSMATE GIRL A,0,0,0,,From where?! How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:30.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Hey, huh? Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:30.74,top,CLASSMATE GIRL C,0,0,0,,When did you guys meet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:32.05,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Hang on...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.59,0:07:35.45,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Are they saying {\i0}he's{\i1} the "Prince"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:38.42,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Hey, you know Yoi Takiguichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:39.27,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.62,0:07:41.81,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:43.76,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? Someone famous or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:45.08,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Totally famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.08,0:07:46.52,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,What, you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:49.24,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Isn't she the one they call \N"Prince" even though she's a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:49.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:52.24,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,He's not some super beautiful dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:53.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,He's a {\i1}girl{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.03,0:07:54.49,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.49,0:07:56.75,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Come on, that's just\Nstraight-up rude, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.26,0:08:04.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:18.26,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I don't usually talk to others in class, \Nso that took me by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.81,0:08:21.60,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm glad I was able to clear up \Nany misunderstandings, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.17,0:08:25.25,flashback,CLASSMATE GIRL B,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. You guys just \Nbumped into each other, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:26.80,flashback,CLASSMATE GIRL C,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.80,0:08:31.22,flashback,CLASSMATE GIRL A,0,0,0,,We'd lose both our princes \Nif the two of them got together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:35.76,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The hell was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.76,0:08:40.79,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I see I'm no longer considered a girl \Neven by the girls in my own class.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:44.54,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'll just eat some choco\Nanpan and forget about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.51,0:08:44.54,top,DRUNK,0,0,0,,Hey there, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:47.20,Default,DRUNK,0,0,0,,What time d'you clock out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:49.57,Default,DRUNK,0,0,0,,Hey, don't ignore me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:50.29,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:50.94,Default,DRUNK,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.38,0:08:53.90,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Don't you see that you're bothering her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:56.34,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,If you keep this up, I'm \Ngoing to call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.79,0:08:58.30,top,DRUNK,0,0,0,,Huh? Who the hell're you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:09:01.56,Default,DRUNK,0,0,0,,You should mind your own business!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:00.36,top,YOI,0,0,0,,Hey—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:02.83,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:03.27,Default,DRUNK,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.49,0:09:06.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nice cheesy line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:09.62,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Th-Th-The provisional Prince?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.58,0:09:10.23,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? Done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:12.44,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Welp, I guess it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:15.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's more than enough to \Ngo viral on the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.39,0:09:18.49,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,"Drunk gets called out for harassing \Na woman and goes apeshit."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.49,0:09:19.92,Default,DRUNK,0,0,0,,Ya little punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:22.68,Default,DRUNK,0,0,0,,Hey! Delete that right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:26.16,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.44,0:09:28.13,Default,DRUNK,0,0,0,,Huh?! Ya—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.49,0:09:31.00,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm saying, "Beat it, you're annoying."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:32.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Read the room, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.71,0:09:34.46,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.89,0:09:37.46,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He's more like a hoodlum than a prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.89,0:09:37.97,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, hey. What are the odds?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.97,0:09:39.80,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We keep bumping into each other, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:39.80,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:43.47,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You live around here? Lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:42.60,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He didn't know it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:44.26,Default,DRUNK,0,0,0,,Why ya little...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.85,0:09:46.77,Default,DRUNK,0,0,0,,Don't ya ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:10:00.62,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's cowardly to attack \Nsomeone from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:10.71,top,STORE MANAGER,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you guys doing out here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:12.59,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? Um, well, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:12.59,top,STORE CLERK,0,0,0,,Manager, that guy is the one to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:15.05,top,DRUNK,0,0,0,,I-I didn't do nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:14.29,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.29,0:10:16.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh, um...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.29,0:10:17.13,overlaptop,STORE MANAGER,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve causing \Ntrouble in my store!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:19.25,top,DRUNK,0,0,0,,Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:20.26,Default,STORE MANAGER,0,0,0,,Quiet! You should be ashamed of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:21.47,Default,STORE CLERK,0,0,0,,That's our manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:29.44,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:34.34,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,How did I end up in this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:35.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Anyway, that move was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:38.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That thing you did like {\i1}this{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:39.74,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Did you study that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.31,0:10:41.90,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,A little karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:44.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Karate! That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:49.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, I kinda understand \Nhow those girls feel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:50.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know, back there...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:53.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,you really did look like a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:10:59.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:02.03,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm not a prince \Nbecause I {\i1}want{\i0} to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.82,0:11:05.07,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I consider myself to be\Nperfectly normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.57,0:11:08.31,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,but everywhere I go,\Nit's "Prince" this and "hero" that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.81,0:11:11.39,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm always put on some pedestal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:14.48,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Why am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:18.41,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,telling him all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.41,0:11:19.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.03,0:11:20.93,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What if you are a prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.25,0:11:25.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Not all girls need to be demure, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.73,0:11:28.58,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's all right if there's a prince-like \Ngirl in the mix once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:30.83,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Actually, that "thing" you just did...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.65,0:11:35.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It made my heart flutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:36.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,A {\i1}lot{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:41.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.15,0:11:43.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Conscientious, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.75,0:11:46.89,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, you're great, Yoi-chan.\NSo intriguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:48.49,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He used "-chan" for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:50.85,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And how does he even know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.11,0:11:55.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I mean, you're this beautiful and you've \Nnever been treated like a princess before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:58.82,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wh-What? N-No, never...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:03.82,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,The guys around you must \Nhave horrible taste in women.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.15,0:12:05.75,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Calling me beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:10.43,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I can't tell if this guy is messing\N with me or being serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:11.27,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Ya want me to carry you like a princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:12.06,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:16.28,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,All right. Hold here and wrap \Nyour hands around my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:16.78,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.07,0:12:19.89,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,And, up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:26.80,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.80,0:12:28.36,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm carrying you like a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:29.54,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:31.89,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Put me down! \NYou'll end up with a broken arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:33.35,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah, this won't break my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:36.86,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Th-That's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:37.62,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Whatcha think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:39.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Feeling pretty heroine-like, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.33,0:12:46.38,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,This is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.28,0:12:48.53,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Just kiddin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:51.24,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But it is a pretty cheesy thing to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.15,0:13:02.96,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:05.67,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's time for me to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:14.34,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,This is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:18.10,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm not the one who gets swept off my feet \Nif I fall down on field day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.35,0:13:20.62,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm not the one who gives \Nchocolate on Valentine's day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.87,0:13:22.66,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,A tall, slender physique.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:24.15,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,A slightly low-pitched voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.15,0:13:26.00,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,A masculine face inherited from my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:30.29,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I know better than anyone that \NI'm not fit to be a heroine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:31.95,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:34.30,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I shouldn't get my hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.47,0:13:38.59,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:41.25,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I was just surprised, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:45.14,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That's the first time something \Nlike that has ever happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:50.52,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,So... just calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.03,0:13:59.16,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:03.15,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, that was real nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.67,0:14:19.29,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,After sleeping on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.29,0:14:22.17,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I've started to feel super embarrassed\Nabout what happened yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:23.50,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.06,0:14:26.13,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wha, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.46,0:14:26.15,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(70,411)\bord0\fs16\c&H7928E8&\b1\t(0,1690,\fs32)\move(187.692,202.615,234.462,195,0,1655)}Whaaa
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:29.13,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Ugh! I'm being way too self-conscious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.13,0:14:31.65,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I've never shown that side \Nof myself to anyone before!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.65,0:14:33.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh. Hey, it's Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:36.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What happened yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:38.68,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You surprised me \Nwhen you just up and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:41.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry, something urgent came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:43.31,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.31,0:14:44.51,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:46.07,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.71,0:14:49.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want\Nto be seen talking to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:52.78,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,considering everyone calls you a prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.27,0:14:54.81,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,People might take it the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:55.74,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:58.08,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Let them take it the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.59,0:15:01.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Actually, y'know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:04.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm interested in you, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.61,0:15:13.54,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:17.60,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Is this some sort of prank or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:18.52,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.17,0:15:22.60,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You know, where someone is hiding \Nand filming us or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:23.61,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.61,0:15:25.49,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Do I look like someone who would—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.49,0:15:26.27,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.27,0:15:30.47,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You say that, but if you don't get what \NI mean when I say, "I'm interested,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.47,0:15:32.70,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't know how else to put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:36.56,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's a little different from "love"...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:38.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, it's hard putting it into words...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:41.29,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:43.18,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's more like, "I want to watch \Nyou forever!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.53,0:15:44.50,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:48.20,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know, like how you just want to keep \Nlooking at something that's beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:51.46,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Like I don't want to take my eyes \Noff ya for even a split second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.46,0:15:52.32,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That kind of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.32,0:15:52.76,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.00,0:15:56.08,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,That's exactly something\Na stalker would say...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:58.97,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Come on, a stalker wouldn't come up and\Ntell their victim about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.64,0:16:01.10,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So, to start,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.77,0:16:05.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,how 'bout we have \Nlunch together today, Yoi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.53,0:16:07.72,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:10.22,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No, I'm good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.78,0:16:16.43,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Really, I haven't had much of \Na relationship with men my whole life...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.80,0:16:23.33,flashback,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Yoi Takiguchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.33,0:16:26.15,flashback,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Nope, there's no way.\NShe's more handsome than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:29.15,flashback,BOY 2,0,0,0,,Girls are better when they're \Ncute, don't ya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:31.50,flashback,BOY 3,0,0,0,,Isn't that the Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.50,0:16:32.74,flashback,BOY 4,0,0,0,,Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.74,0:16:34.31,flashback,BOY 5,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:40.64,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:41.81,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,So...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.74,0:16:45.27,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What is up with this guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:48.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I can't believe he calls me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:49.30,top,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan's looking kinda sexy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:50.85,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,He should really call me Takiguchi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:51.70,top,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Even her melancholy face is picturesque.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.06,0:16:56.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And "I want to watch you forever," \Nlike I'm some sort of house plant...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.97,0:17:01.86,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I can't imagine someone called "Prince" \Nwould ever bother to take interest in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:05.32,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You know... You're really beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.37,0:17:07.21,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.21,0:17:10.06,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I bet he says that\Nsort of thing to all the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.06,0:17:11.34,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:13.63,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Let's eat lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:14.85,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:17.56,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Is your bento box today \Nyour dad's specialty dish?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:20.15,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Must be nice.\NI've got to try it again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.15,0:17:21.97,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sure, stop by anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.01,0:17:25.58,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, there she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:30.27,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan, you got some time right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:37.32,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Th-The provisional Prince?!\NI can't believe he actually came!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:36.42,top,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?! Did he just say "Yoi-chan?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:38.70,top,GIRL A,0,0,0,,Are those two really in \Nthat sort of relationship?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.90,0:17:44.98,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:46.89,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,S-Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:49.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,There's a committee meeting \Nthis afternoon, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.38,0:17:50.34,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:53.70,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Then we can't be standing here!\NNow, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.70,0:17:54.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.09,0:17:55.88,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Just come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:57.37,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh, you're real strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:17:58.84,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Is this karate, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:03.61,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Huh? So, what exactly was \Nthe deal with those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:12.02,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Even your sudden lies are \Nflawlessly proper, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:15.85,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Better question... What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:17.99,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,The old school building.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:19.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I come here all the time with my buds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.69,0:18:24.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Not that. I mean, why do I have to \Neat lunch in a place like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.25,0:18:27.49,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, 'cause you don't want \Nothers to see you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:39.55,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Ugh, whatever. I'll just \Neat quickly and head back...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.18,0:18:42.46,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:48.35,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, aren't you going to sit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:52.44,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:55.02,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Right there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.02,0:18:57.64,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Or would it be more strange \Nto eat sitting far apart?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:02.57,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.74,0:19:05.54,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Was he doing that \Nto be considerate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:11.98,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm just overthinking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:17.09,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He has such long, beautiful fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.77,0:19:22.07,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder if that's what it means \Nto have a well-balanced face?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:26.99,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Is that why he's called the Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.43,0:19:31.94,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.\NI'd better just get through my meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.93,0:19:37.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? Curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.23,0:19:40.85,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Shoot... I just did it without thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.85,0:19:43.53,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Not only that, isn't it \Nreally elaborately prepped?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:50.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:53.59,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We run a curry restaurant, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:58.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.43,0:20:02.81,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wow, a curry restaurant! \NI've never met someone who runs one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.81,0:20:04.46,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I get that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:07.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Whoa, for real? That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.11,0:20:09.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You get to eat delicious \Ncurry whenever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.37,0:20:13.82,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't really \Nwant the word to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:15.96,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,People would give me\Nweird nicknames...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.35,0:20:17.56,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Weird nicknames?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.15,0:20:19.78,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You swear you won't laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:21.31,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.27,0:20:26.16,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:28.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,200)}C-Curry Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:30.08,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}C-Curry Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:31.16,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}C-Curry Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:32.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}C-Curry Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:33.58,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}C-Curry Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:34.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}C-Curry Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:35.92,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}C-Curry Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:36.92,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,400)}C-Curry Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:36.92,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(1295,0)\c&H0FF5F6&\3c&H86380C&\b1\fnTrebuchet MS\bord3.5\b1\fs28\frz351.2\move(253,238.667,254,220,0,2087)}Curry Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:44.34,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,See? I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:46.34,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I don't like saying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.34,0:20:48.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I like that you run a curry place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.13,0:20:50.07,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.53,0:20:51.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.91,0:20:56.10,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,How is that cute?! \NPlease don't patronize me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:20:57.81,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm not patronizing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.81,0:21:00.66,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,The way you act so \Nself-conscious about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:02.49,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,How unexpected it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.93,0:21:06.20,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're just cute, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:07.23,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,There he goes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.63,0:21:11.49,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Could you please stop teasing me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.43,0:21:13.95,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I never know how to respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:27.89,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yep, and it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.41,0:21:33.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:36.25,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,but there's something\Nabout you, Yoi-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.59,0:21:39.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,that keeps me at the edge \Nof my seat, wanting more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:43.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What kind of face are you gonna make next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:48.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Show me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:53.96,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,This is the first time in my life \Nthat I'm getting hit on by a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.57,0:21:57.83,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.67,0:21:59.81,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I can't even!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.39,0:22:04.86,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And that guy is the Prince.
